# Way of the Cryomancer (turn 1, off a Black Lotus): empower Jace 5 makes a Jace token at 5 loyalty, and the planeswalkers Bot1
# controls have "[-3]: When you next cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn, copy that spell." The token activates it (5 to 2,
# a delayed ability waits, CR 603.7b). Casting Ornithopter, a creature spell, neither triggers it nor uses it up. The first Lightning
# Bolt, at Bot2, is then copied, and Bot1 aims the copy at itself (CR 707.10c): 3 damage each. The second Bolt, at Bot2, is not copied
# ("next" is once; Delayed is empty again): Bot2 ends at 14 (20 - 3 - 3), Bot1 at 17.

